.el .ds Aq '
.TH portensor-db-update 1  "update "
.SH NAME
portensor\-db\-update \- Download, verify, and index the latest NVD CVE feeds
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBupdate\fR [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-\-years\fR] [\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Download, verify, and index the latest NVD CVE feeds
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Re\-download feeds even when their published digest matches
.TP
\fB\-\-years\fR \fI<SPEC>\fR
Year selection: all (default), 2002\-2026, or 2024,2025,2026
.TP
\fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress progress output
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
